  "description": "Dusty Saloon – Bold Western Slab Serif Font\nDusty Saloon is a bold vintage western slab serif font inspired by old wanted posters, saloon signs, rodeo flyers, and classic letterpress printing. With its chunky letterforms, soft rounded corners, and subtle inked texture, this display font brings an authentic Wild West charm to any design project.\nPerfect for crafters, branding designers, and small business owners, Dusty Saloon is a versatile western font that stands out in both large headlines and small, punchy text. .",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Dusty Saloon – Bold Western Slab Serif Font</p>\n<p>Dusty Saloon is a bold vintage western slab serif font inspired by old wanted posters, saloon signs, rodeo flyers, and classic letterpress printing. With its chunky letterforms, soft rounded corners, and subtle inked texture, this display font brings an authentic Wild West charm to any design project.</p>\n<p>Perfect for crafters, branding designers, and small business owners, Dusty Saloon is a versatile western font that stands out in both large headlines and small, punchy text. .</p>",
